&lt;p&gt;发布日期：2018 年 10 月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;iframe src=&#34;//player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=34440102&amp;bvid=BV19t411R7FR&amp;cid=60328869&amp;page=1&amp;high_quality=1&amp;danmaku=0&amp;autoplay=0&#34; allowfullscreen=&#34;allowfullscreen&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;500&#34; scrolling=&#34;no&#34; frameborder=&#34;0&#34; sandbox=&#34;allow-top-navigation allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-scripts&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
